  "body": "### Summary\n\nThe new followed-list capture `R73b` (account on the `defaut` theme, 27 poll rows) shows that legacy finds no poll there, while `R73a` (theme `images_forum/1`) shows legacy **does** find the poll icon. `TopicListRowParser` is right on both (any `sondage.gif`), but its comment and the D5 assertion of `FavoritesDifferentialTests` say the opposite, so `R73b` is parked in `pendingCases`.\n\n### Facts\n\n- `R73a` (`Fixtures/LOT-002/R73a.oracle.json`): row 2 links `…/themes_static/images_forum/1/sondage.gif` in `sujetCase2`; legacy `isPoll` = true.\n- `R73b`: 27 rows link `…/themes_static/images/defaut/sondage.gif`; legacy `isPoll` = false on all 88 rows; the Swift parser finds 27 polls (matches the page).\n- So the comment of `TopicListRowParser.swift:94-95` (\"legacy matched `…/images/defaut/sondage.gif` only and never found a poll\", LOT-002 RC2.3) is inverted: legacy matched the `images_forum/1` icon and misses the `defaut` theme.\n\n### Scope\n\n1. `Packages/HFRKit/Tests/HFRParsingTests/TopicList/FavoritesParserTests.swift`: move `R73b` from `pendingCases` to `cases`; assert `row.isPoll == legacy.isPoll` except where the row shows a `defaut`-theme poll icon, where legacy is `false` (an intentional difference).\n2. Fix the comment of `TopicListRowParser.isPoll` and the RC2.3 / D5 wording in `docs/lots/LOT-002-list-oracle.md` and `docs/lots/LOT-024-favourites-parser.md`.\n3. Check `TopicListDifferentialTests` for the same assumption.\n\nNo HFR request needed. Engine tests only.\n\nRefs #109\n",
